BiliNote https://github.com/JefferyHcool/BiliNote
Commit 90940fde4d224d0f69ad99674f4af0a1ea52d3c4; MIT; Copyright (c) 2024 Jeffery Huang.
Reference: backend/app/utils/video_reader.py and backend/app/gpt/request_chunker.py.
The new implementation follows the scene/time-grid/grouping and bounded-message
organization ideas. It is rewritten around scoped immutable objects, per-task
directories, tail preservation, cancellation, and the existing host Model Gateway.
No BiliNote UI, Chroma/vector store, account system, scheduler, credentials,
downloaders or PDF/export dependencies are redistributed.

DTK https://github.com/Evil0ctal/Douyin_TikTok_Download_API
Commit 3d540dbf3783449e638403b65d81c882c4a99575; Apache-2.0; Evil0ctal contributors.
Only a protocol client is implemented here. DTK source is not vendored or packaged.
Its own distribution, license and third-party dependency notices remain required
when deploying that separate service. No watchlist or identity/captcha bypass is
started or implemented by this adapter.

